---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Studies & Results | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Real results from real campaigns. See how One Take Wonder Marketing delivers measurable ROI for local businesses across TV, OTT, digital, and full-service marketing engagements."
>

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="bg-gray-900 py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">Results</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Real Campaigns, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Real Numbers</span></h1>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Every campaign we run is measured, tracked, and reported. Here's what that looks like in practice.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Key Stats -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center">
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink">3.2x</div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Average Client ROI</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+247%</div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Avg. Revenue Growth</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink">500+</div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Campaigns Delivered</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-pink">10+</div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Years of Results</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Case Study Cards -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="section-label">Featured Work</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-4">Campaigns That <span class="gradient-text">Delivered</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Case Study 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 group hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 h-2"></div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-brand-pink/10 text-brand-pink text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">TV + Digital</span>
            <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Healthcare</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Regional Medical Practice Sees 3.8x Return on Multi-Channel Campaign</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Combined broadcast TV, OTT streaming, and paid search into an integrated campaign that drove new patient appointments across three locations.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">3.8x</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">ROI</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+156%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">New Patients</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">$1.2M</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Revenue</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 group hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 h-2"></div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-brand-pink/10 text-brand-pink text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">OTT + Social</span>
            <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Home Services</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Home Services Company Cuts Cost-Per-Lead by 42% with OTT Campaign</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Shifted budget from traditional TV to targeted OTT placements on streaming platforms, dramatically improving lead quality while reducing cost-per-lead.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">-42%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Cost Per Lead</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+89%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Lead Quality</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">5.1x</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">ROAS</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 group hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 h-2"></div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-brand-pink/10 text-brand-pink text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Full Service</span>
            <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Professional Services</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Law Firm Grows Revenue 247% in 18 Months with Full-Service Partnership</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Took over complete marketing function — TV, digital, content, and web — transforming a single-location firm into a regional powerhouse with measurable revenue growth.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+247%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Revenue Growth</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">3x</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Client Base</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">18 mo</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Timeline</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 group hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 h-2"></div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="bg-brand-pink/10 text-brand-pink text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Web + SEO</span>
            <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-500 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Retail</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Retailer Increases Online Sales 312% After Website Redesign & SEO Campaign</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Complete website redesign combined with aggressive local SEO strategy drove dramatic organic traffic growth and converted browsers into buyers.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+312%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Online Sales</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">#1-3</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Local Rankings</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-pink">+198%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Organic Traffic</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How We Measure -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="section-label">Accountability</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading mb-6">We <span class="gradient-text">Prove</span> Every Dollar</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg mb-12">
      Marketing should never be a black box. Here's how we make sure you always know what's working.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Custom Dashboards</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Real-time reporting dashboards built for your specific KPIs. See performance at a glance, any time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Monthly ROI Reports</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Detailed monthly reports that connect every dollar spent to actual business outcomes — not just vanity metrics.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-pink/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Quarterly Reviews</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Sit down with your dedicated team every quarter to review results, discuss insights, and plan the next phase of growth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
      Want Results Like These?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">
      Let's talk about what we can achieve together. We'll put together a free proposal tailored to your business and budget.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Get Your Free Proposal</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
